### Peticiones de prueba para event-service (Sesión 4)
### IntelliJ IDEA (HTTP Client): los login guardan el token con client.global.set(...).
### VS Code (REST Client): copia el accessToken de cada login en la variable {{...Token}} correspondiente.
### Ejecuta primero los login (user-service en 8084). GET es público; escribir requiere ORGANIZER o ADMIN; eliminar, solo ADMIN.

@host = http://localhost:8081/api/v1
@auth = http://localhost:8084/api/v1

### ---------- AUTENTICACIÓN (ejecutar primero) ----------

### Login ORGANIZER (organizer@ticketing.pe) -> 200
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "organizer@ticketing.pe",
  "password": "Organizer123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("organizerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login CUSTOMER Ana (ana@mail.com) -> 200
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@mail.com",
  "password": "Customer123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("anaToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Login ADMIN (admin@ticketing.pe) -> 200
POST {{auth}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ticketing.pe",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### ---------- RECINTOS ----------

### Listar recintos (público, sin token) -> 200
GET {{host}}/venues

### Obtener recinto por id -> 200
GET {{host}}/venues/1

### S4: Crear recinto sin token -> 401
POST {{host}}/venues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Peruano Japonés",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Gregorio Escobedo 803, Jesús María",
  "capacity": 1200
}

### S4: Crear recinto como CUSTOMER -> 403
POST {{host}}/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Peruano Japonés",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Gregorio Escobedo 803, Jesús María",
  "capacity": 1200
}

### Crear recinto como ORGANIZER -> 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Teatro Peruano Japonés",
  "city": "Lima",
  "address": "Av. Gregorio Escobedo 803, Jesús María",
  "capacity": 1200
}

### Crear recinto inválido -> 400 con lista de errores
POST {{host}}/venues
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "city": "Lima",
  "capacity": 0
}

### ---------- EVENTOS ----------

### Listar todos los eventos (público) -> 200
GET {{host}}/events

### Filtrar por ciudad, categoría y estado -> 200
GET {{host}}/events?city=lima&status=PUBLISHED

### Obtener evento por id -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1

### Evento inexistente -> 404 (ProblemDetail)
GET {{host}}/events/999

### Zonas (ticket categories) de un evento -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1/ticket-categories

### Disponibilidad y precio de una zona (la consulta booking-service, sin token) -> 200
GET {{host}}/events/1/ticket-categories/1/availability

### Crear evento como ORGANIZER -> 201 (nace en DRAFT)
POST {{host}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Noche de Stand Up",
  "description": "Comediantes nacionales",
  "category": "COMEDY",
  "venueId": 2,
  "dateTime": "2027-03-01T21:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "Preferencial",
      "price": 120.0,
      "capacity": 300
    },
    {
      "name": "General",
      "price": 80.0,
      "capacity": 700
    }
  ]
}

### Bean Validation: fecha pasada y zona con precio negativo -> 400
POST {{host}}/events
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Evento del pasado",
  "category": "MUSIC",
  "venueId": 1,
  "dateTime": "2020-01-01T20:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "VIP",
      "price": -10,
      "capacity": 100
    }
  ]
}

### Publicar evento sin zonas -> 409
PATCH {{host}}/events/3/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Actualizar evento (agregar zonas al evento 3, que está en DRAFT) -> 200
PUT {{host}}/events/3
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "La Casa de Bernarda Alba",
  "description": "Clásico de García Lorca",
  "category": "THEATER",
  "venueId": 3,
  "dateTime": "2027-01-20T19:00:00",
  "ticketCategories": [
    {
      "name": "Platea",
      "price": 90.0,
      "capacity": 500
    },
    {
      "name": "Mezzanine",
      "price": 60.0,
      "capacity": 300
    }
  ]
}

### Publicar evento como ORGANIZER -> 200
PATCH {{host}}/events/3/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### S4: Publicar como CUSTOMER -> 403
PATCH {{host}}/events/3/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{anaToken}}

### S4: Eliminar evento como ORGANIZER -> 403 (solo ADMIN)
DELETE {{host}}/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{organizerToken}}

### Eliminar evento como ADMIN -> 204
DELETE {{host}}/events/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
